{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"agent_message","text":"Level 4 starts with the avatar inside a rectangular divider, six pieces inside, one outside, and seven marked cells outside. Clone tests show actions 1–4 move the avatar; another object also moves each turn. I’ll test pickup and handoff behavior, then check whether the existing handoff leg can finish this layout."}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"cat > probe_mechanics.py <<'PY'\nimport json,time\nimport gkm_try as H\nfrom perception import block_signatures, replay\nfrom legs import handoff_across_barrier\n\ndef state(e):\n s=block_signatures(e.frame()); return {str(k):[p for p,v in s.items() if k in v] for k in [14,4,12,2]}\ndef probe(e):\n for a in json.load(open('checkpoint.json'))['final_path']: e.step(a)\n print('entry',state(e))\n for path in [[1,3,1,5],[1,3,1,5,3],[1,3,1,5,3,5],[1,3,1,5,3,5,4,5],[1,3,1,5,3,5,4]+[5]*40]:\n  c=replay(e,path);print('P',path[:8],len(path),state(c),'L',c.levels_completed)\n t=e.clone();start=time.monotonic()\n try: handoff_across_barrier(t); print('LEG OK',t.levels_completed)\n except Exception as x: print('LEG FAIL',str(x),state(t))\n print('seconds',round(time.monotonic()-start,2))\nH.A.run_program('wa30',probe)\nPY\npython probe_mechanics.py\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
